  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{2 (1)/(2)-((1)/(2)+overline{(1)/(6)-(1)/(7)})right}]}{6}\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5150c5b90ff0d3fbdd6a542cbd6ec09a59c26abaae848bd31e3bf0035c4d0714.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{2 (1)/(2)-((1)/(2)+overline{(1)/(6)-(1)/(7)})right}]}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{2 (1)/(2)-((1)/(2)+( {(1)/(6)-(1)/(7)})right}])}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{2 (1)/(2)-((1)/(2)+{(7-6)/(42)})right}]}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{2 (1)/(2)-((1)/(2)+{(1)/(42)})right}]}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{2 (1)/(2)-({(21 + 1)/(42)})right}]}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{2 (1)/(2)-({(22)/(42)})right}]}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{(5)/(2)-({(22)/(42)})right}]}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{(105-22)/(42)right}]}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{3)/(4)+left{(83)/(42)right}]}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{63+166)/(84)]}{6}\n\n⇒ (5-[frac{229)/(84)]}{6}\n\n⇒ (frac{420 - 229)/(84)}{6}\n\n⇒ (frac{191)/(84)}{6}\n\n⇒ (191)/(504)\n\n**∴ The required answer is (191)/(504).**",
